{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage a crane game store in Claw Crane Company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish the proper shape and strength of the claw, the price of the game, and organize the prizes well, to be the most famous game store in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to satisfy clients and don't make him angry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use your favorite image as the background of the machine, and also add original prizes although it requires a little more effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, it is also possible to publish the prizes you create at the workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the center of the store there is a mysterious crane machine that changes its contents every day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To unlock new gifts, play and get from that crane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many kinds of prizes such as plush doll, figures, sweets, drinks, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is also a goal unlock all prizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About video streaming, uploading video, etc.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play this game live or upload videos at your own risk, and monetize those videos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Important: Be sure to include the game's name in a visible place, such as in the title, description, or within the video.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ac34d627ad09ea294b23ce3210a86f5ab840fabf.jpg","localized_name":"Beginner","name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345140/ac34d627ad09ea294b23ce3210a86f5ab840fabf.jpg"},{"icon":"854d523404ebe6768fee4c005b6c028946d86727.jpg","localized_name":"A Little Famous","name":"A Little Famous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1345140/854d5